<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_author">A. Yang, A. Li, B. Yang, B. Zhang, B. Hui, B. Zheng, B. Yu, C. Gao, C. Huang, C. Lv, <span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_etal">et al.</span></span><span class="ltx_text ltx_bib_year"> (2025)</span>
