</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock ltx_bib_cited">Cited by: <a href="#S4.SS4.p1.1" title="IV-D Q2: Comparison with LLMs ‣ IV Experiment ‣ Mental-R1: Aligning LLM Reasoning for Mental Health Assessment" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">§IV-D</span></a>.
</span></li>
